# --- 2026-07-13 FF native full-res HTML viewers + scratch (working-tree cleanup) ---
# FF cell/ECM HTML viewers under outputs/ff/figs/ are native full-res — 264-485 MB each
# (5.8 GB untracked total). Regenerable from the run; the committed record is the PNG
# figures + curves + JSON data (PI native-viewer rule). Large morphology viewers are
# release-uploaded for the gh-pages gallery, not git; lightweight demo HTMLs here are
# dev scratch. The 14 already-tracked HTMLs stay tracked — this only stops NEW ones.
aleph/outputs/ff/figs/*.html
# underscore-prefixed scratch/diagnostic dumps (convention) + TAG query scratch txt
aleph/outputs/ff/figs/_*
aleph/outputs/tag_kb/_*.txt

